                <pb facs="0405" n="349" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg349"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract from the Japan Daily
                    Herald.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Address of Her Majesty the Empress at the opening of
                        the Tokei normal school</hi>.</head>
                <p>My joy was very great last year on learning the decision for the establishment of
                    an institution of this nature. To-day the wish that I have so often expressed
                    has been, realized. The building is finished, and the opening has taken place. I
                    venture to hope that this great event will be the epoch of a new source of
                    happiness for the entire empire.</p>
            </div>
